== a ~ PATH entry is $HOME's
zztilde: from HOME
D/home/tbin/zztilde
== an inherited variable unset or unexported does not reach a child
unset: gone, export -n: gone
== a missing interpreter
./a.sh: zzmissing: bad interpreter: No such file or directory
rc=126
/usr/bin/env: 'zzmissing': No such file or directory
rc=127
